This repository and related release packages contain two distinct legal layers:

1. Qwen-derived materials and obligations
2. Nano-specific code, packaging, and documentation by RthItalia

By using, copying, modifying, or redistributing any part of this repository or any release package produced from it, you agree to the terms below.

## 1. Scope

This license applies to:

- repository source code
- exporter and runtime code
- release packaging logic
- documentation and model cards
- self-contained compact exports and related release folders produced by this repository

This repository may also include or produce materials derived from upstream Qwen models. Those derived materials remain subject to the upstream Qwen Research License obligations described below.

## 2. Upstream Qwen-Derived Materials

Any of the following, when derived from `Qwen/Qwen2.5-*` or other Qwen materials, remain subject to the Qwen Research License Agreement:

- derivative weights
- compact exported checkpoints
- tokenizer assets distributed with a Qwen-derived release
- documentation or release packages describing or carrying such derived artifacts

For those Qwen-derived materials:

- non-commercial research and evaluation use only
- commercial use requires the appropriate upstream license
- required upstream attribution must be preserved
- modified files must be clearly identified where applicable

The required upstream attribution is preserved in the accompanying `NOTICE` file.

## 3. Nano-Specific Additions by RthItalia

Unless a file explicitly says otherwise, the Nano-specific additions in this repository are provided by RthItalia for non-commercial research and evaluation purposes only.

These Nano-specific additions include:

- exporter code
- runtime loader code
- compact packaging logic
- benchmarking helpers
- release scripts
- repository documentation specific to the Nano compact workflow

Commercial use of these Nano-specific additions requires prior written permission from RthItalia.

